    "scenesThatPass": [
      "KIRSTY: No! You... You can't! It wasn't me...I didn't do it! I didn't open the box!\nFEMALE CENOBITE: Didn't open the box. And what was it last time? Didn't know what the box was. And yet we DO keep finding each other, don't we?",
      "FEMALE CENOBITE: Perhaps you're teasing us. Are you teasing us?\nKIRSTY: But I didn't open it! I didn't!",
      "KIRSTY: It's you! You HAVEN'T always been as you are. You were HUMAN. Remember. Remember all your confusions. Think!\nFEMALE CENOBITE: Enough!",
      "TIFFANY: I have to go back. Or it'll never stop.\nKIRSTY: What are you talking...\nTIFFANY: I've got to finish it.\nKIRSTY: Finish what?",
      "KIRSTY: Oh, gross.\nKIRSTY: What are you doing? What are WE doing?\nTIFFANY: I can't do it here. I have to go to it."
    ]
  },
